  Description: In the chaotic rush of battle, you learned to adapt to rapidly changing
    conditions as you administered to battle casualties. You patched up soldiers,
    guards, or other combatants, and learned a fair amount about the logistics of
    war. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Constitution or Wisdom , and
    one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Medicine skill and the Warfare
    Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Battle Medicine]
    skill feat.
